# Document Image Processing: Going beyond the Black-and-White Barrier. Progress, Issues and Options with Greyscale and Colour Image Processing.

**Authors:** Hendley, Tom

## Abstract
Discussion of digital document image processing focuses on issues and options associated with greyscale and color image processing. Topics include speed; size of original document; scanning resolution; markets for different categories of scanners, including photographic libraries, publishing, and office applications; hybrid systems; data compression; and examples of color imaging, including fax. (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ503443

